pdf-equilibrist (0.1.14-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix CVE checker on frozen builds: the purelib-scoped dependency scan
    (added to avoid --system-site-packages noise on Linux venv packages)
    broke Windows' PyInstaller exe, which bundles dist-info metadata next
    to the executable rather than under a Lib/site-packages tree. Frozen
    builds now fall back to the unrestricted scan; this Linux package was
    never affected (it never took the frozen code path).

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 22:30:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.13-3) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add debian/source/include-binaries for the two app-icon PNGs — the
    "3.0 (quilt)" source format refuses any binary file under debian/
    unless explicitly whitelisted there.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:40:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.13-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix debian/rules: clean up debian/venv-build on `dh_auto_clean` — left
    in place, it made `dpkg-source -b` (needed for the real Launchpad
    source-only upload) refuse the package ("unwanted binary file") on
    every leftover .so/.pyc from a prior local build.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:35:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.13-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Explicitly declare the .desktop file id via QApplication.setDesktopFileName()
    (detected at runtime: "pdf-equilibrist" for PPA, "io.github.BitScripts.PDFEquilibrist"
    for AUR) — under GNOME/Wayland, the dock doesn't reliably match a window
    to its .desktop entry via WM_CLASS/process name alone, unlike KDE.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:20:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.12-4) noble; urgency=medium

  * Install the app icon under /usr/share/icons/hicolor/<size>/apps/
    instead of the legacy /usr/share/pixmaps/ fallback — the GNOME/Ubuntu
    dock resolves dock/taskbar icons poorly from pixmaps alone. Same
    approach already used by the AUR package.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:10:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.12-3) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix debian/rules: install the launcher/.desktop from debian/ (the
    directory actually used for this build), not packaging/ppa/debian/
    (a stale copy frozen inside the upstream source tarball) — the -2
    launcher fix never actually took effect because of this.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:00:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.12-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix launcher: exec the venv's own pip-generated entry-point script
    instead of `python3 -m pdf_equilibrist.main` — the latter made the
    process (and its WM_CLASS) show up as "python3", breaking the
    taskbar/dock icon association with the .desktop file.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 14:45:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.12-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix update checker: bundled venv now injects __version__ correctly,
    and offers the apt upgrade command instead of the Windows installer.
  * Fix CVE scanner scope: only the app's own dependencies, not every
    package visible via --system-site-packages.

